#
# .claspignore
# What clasp must not push into the Apps Script project.
#
# Created: 2026-08-30
# Copyright (c) 2026 Cloudmanic Labs, LLC. All rights reserved.
#
# The Node test suite is the reason this file exists. Apps Script has no module
# system, so a pushed test/params.test.js would be concatenated into the same
# global scope as the connector and its `require` calls would fail at load,
# breaking every entry point.
#

test/**
node_modules/**
README.md
LICENSE
.claspignore
.clasp.json
